{'symbol': 'BIIB', 'date': '2022-06-06 07:30:00', 'title': "BIOGEN AND ALECTOS THERAPEUTICS ANNOUNCE LICENSE AND COLLABORATION AGREEMENT FOR AL01811, A NOVEL GBA2 INHIBITOR FOR THE POTENTIAL TREATMENT OF PARKINSON'S DISEASE", 'text': "CAMBRIDGE, MASS. AND BURNABY, BRITISH COLUMBIA, JUNE 06, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BIOGEN INC. (NASDAQ: BIIB) -- BIOGEN AND ALECTOS THERAPEUTICS HAVE ENTERED INTO A LICENSE AND COLLABORATION AGREEMENT TO DEVELOP AND COMMERCIALIZE A NOVEL PRECLINICAL SELECTIVE GBA2 INHIBITOR, AL01811, WHICH HAS FIRST-IN-CLASS POTENTIAL AS AN ORAL DISEASE MODIFYING TREATMENT FOR PATIENTS WITH PARKINSON'S DISEASE (PD). THIS COLLABORATION COMBINES ALECTOS' EXPERTISE IN SMALL-MOLECULE THERAPEUTICS WITH BIOGEN'S DEVELOPMENT CAPABILITIES IN MOVEMENT DISORDERS."}